# ============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: These files MUST remain public (DO NOT IGNORE)
# ============================================================================
# Cargo.toml - Rust project configuration (PUBLIC)
# .github/ - CI/CD workflows (PUBLIC)
# .gitmodules - Git submodule configuration (PUBLIC)
# .coderabbit.yaml - Code review configuration (PUBLIC)
# LICENSE - License file (PUBLIC)
# README.md - Project documentation (PUBLIC)
# CHANGELOG.md - Change log (PUBLIC)
# CONTRIBUTING.md - Contribution guidelines (PUBLIC)

